  dialogueSteps:
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Questioning
    dialogueEN: Why is the rope broken? Why?
    dialogueID: Kok talinya putus? Kenapa gitu?
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: Forget it, this is just my hallucination.
    dialogueID: Lupakan, ini hanya halusinasiku.
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: I have to get out first.
    dialogueID: Aku harus keluar terlebih dahulu.
  - characterName: Elara
    expressionName: Normal
    dialogueEN: Follow those butterflies again.
    dialogueID: Ikutin kupu-kupu itu lagi.
